{'symbol': 'CARR', 'date': '2022-12-07 16:15:00', 'title': 'CARRIER BOARD OF DIRECTORS INCREASES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND BY 23%', 'text': 'PALM BEACH GARDENS, FLA. , DEC. 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CARRIER GLOBAL CORPORATION (NYSE: CARR), THE LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF HEALTHY, SAFE, SUSTAINABLE AND INTELLIGENT BUILDING AND COLD CHAIN SOLUTIONS, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.185 PER OUTSTANDING SHARE OF CARRIER COMMON STOCK, WHICH REPRESENTS A 23% INCREASE OVER THE PRIOR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND.'}